                                "example_id": "a4d0c2f7-397a-4f80-97d0-5d196dfc6636",
                                "sense_id": "718211da-d64b-3d43-9162-50b4af46bd57",
                                "text": "According to the school newspaper, the Daily 49er, a group of approximately 24 Cal State Long Beach students \"tribbed\" (or scissored--you know) with each other for some 10 minutes in protest of the censorship of the title of their play, The Night of the Tribades."
